<div class="product-tiers-intro">
  <p>
    Guido is in closed beta on Android, and we're letting people in a few at a time. Joining early is the way to shape
    the app: tell us what's broken, what's missing, and which sim Guido should learn next. If you'd rather wait for
    something finished, that's fair — this isn't it yet.
  </p>
  <p>
    What beta means, plainly: the app will be updated frequently, and features might move or change shape between
    sessions, and there are rough edges we haven't sanded down.
  </p>
  <p class="product-tiers-benefits">
    <strong>Your benefits.</strong> Guido before the public launch, a direct say in what gets built, and a line to us
    while the decisions are still open.
  </p>
</div>
